</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mo>−</mo><mn>60</mn></menclose><mi>t</mi></mrow><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mo>−</mo><mn>60</mn></menclose></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mn>8.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, Mary reaches the halfway point after <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"54\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> minutes.</p>\n</div></div>             \n\n                           \n                    </div>",
